OL,3,APontins fined #1m after grandmother's  
OL,4,Adeath                                  
OL,6,FPontins holiday park resort has been   
OL,7,Ffined #1m after a grandmother died in a
OL,8,F"catastrophic incident" that was "an   
OL,9,Faccident waiting to happen", a judge   
OL,10,Fruled.                                 
OL,12,FWendy Jones, 68, of Hereford, died six 
OL,13,Fmonths after a 40m (131ft) section of  
OL,14,Fair conditioning duct and ceiling      
OL,15,Fcollapsed onto guests at Pontins' Brean
OL,16,FSands resort, Somerset, in February    
OL,17,F2019.                                  
OL,19,FOn Friday, Pontins' parent firm,       
OL,20,FBritannia Jinky Jersey, was sentenced  
OL,21,Fat Bristol Crown Court to pay a #1m    
OL,22,Ffine.                                  
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
